# lane c2-fx: IEffects' oracle (EffectsClient.cpp, probe copy). Every call, the
# suppression state it saw, the random draw and the FX_* call it made: from
# networked temp entities (cs_te_fire all), from the backend scaffolding, and
# from the arms a session does not reach alone (SuppressEvents on, the ricochet
# sound suppressed, each muzzle-flash type). Needs the probe build.
wait managed client module initialized 120
cmd map dm_lockdown
wait first paint 240
sleep 3
cmd sv_cheats 1
cmd cs_te_fire all
sleep 0.5
